# function                    bytes   (release build, x86-64 GCC)
#
# Over the ceiling and left that way, each with its reason. A frame
# that is not listed here fails the sweep; one that grows past what is
# recorded fails too, and the number moves in the commit that grows it.
#
# switch_res_crt          a CRT mode switch, once when the resolution
#                         changes, on the main thread
# spirv_cache_save        shader cache written once per compiled pass,
# spirv_cache_load        read once per pass at load
# gfx_anim_preview_probe  probes a preview file, off the frame path
switch_res_crt              4440
spirv_cache_save            4312
spirv_cache_load            4296
gfx_anim_preview_probe      4128
